Python package: quantlens, matching the repo name.
GitHub description: A from-scratch GPT-2 inference engine for studying where low-bit quantization breaks.
Topics: pytorch, llm-inference, quantization, gpt-2, transformers.
Rules: lowercase, no spaces, and keep "from scratch" in the description, not the name.
